                            <a href="#"><img src="img/Study in Remarketing Ads.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="Role Of Voice Search SEO" /></a><br>
                            <div class="cus-bullet">
                                <h3>TABLE OF CONTENT</h3>
                                <li><a href="#1">Understanding the Basics</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#2">Consumer Behavior</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#3">Data Analysis</a></li>
